        "description": "A2A Agent Card (spec v0.3.0) - pre-connect agent discovery document.\n\nDiscovery/branding only: it advertises this agent's identity and skills so\nA2A registries/clients can find it. We intentionally do not declare a\n``preferredTransport`` because the template implements no A2A wire transport;\nadvertising one would point clients at an endpoint that can't speak it.",
        "operationId": "a2a_agent_card__well_known_agent_card_json_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/.well-known/api-catalog": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "well-known"
        ],
        "summary": "Api Catalog",
        "description": "RFC 9727 API catalog - points agents/crawlers at the OpenAPI description.\n\nReturns an RFC 9264 linkset whose ``service-desc`` link references this\nserver's OpenAPI document, so function-calling agents can discover the\nmachine-readable API contract from one well-known URL. Absolute URLs are\nemitted when ``API_PUBLIC_URL`` is configured (matching the OpenAPI\n``servers`` block); otherwise relative hrefs let the client resolve them\nagainst the request origin.",
        "operationId": "api_catalog__well_known_api_catalog_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
